  "description": "Pins protocol::encode_workspace_blob_raw + protocol::decode_workspace_blob byte mapping for the MYW1 vault.workspace encrypted editor-workspace-state codec (MYND-254; codec landed MYND-166). The inner plaintext is OPAQUE (client-serialized pane-tree descriptor) — no canonical-JSON discipline, unlike vault-prefs. session_state_key = derive_subkey(root_key, SubkeyRole::SessionStateKey) (role 'session-state-key'); account_number_hash binds via aad_workspace_blob (role 'workspace-blob' — a DISTINCT load-bearing string). 12 cases: 3 encrypt (empty / small descriptor / 1-KB) + 1 decrypt_ok + 2 decrypt_aead_fail (tag-tamper + cross-vault, both non-distinguishing per §6.4) + 6 parse_fail (one per distinguishable pre-decryption structural reject). Cases generated by `cargo test -p protocol --lib emit_vault_workspace_vectors_for_paste -- --ignored` (in protocol/src/workspace_blob.rs).",
